## Fixture caveats

- 288-tensor conversion, NO q/k-norm (the Bench-004 fixture) — trap-1 re-arms on a standard conversion.
- Simulation law: lossy rows are rewritten into the plain cache at TILE close (KVarN's own streaming visibility — within-open-tile reads raw, closed-tile reads dequantized). Storage is virtual; the quality surface is exact.
- KVarN instantiation: tile 128, hadamard OFF, var-norm ON at b > 2, skip-varn + grouped-4 RTN at b2.
- Tap point: pre-RoPE K / post-W_V V; RoVE OFF (the default decode path). Freeze λ_js = 0; untracked tokens take the plain path (never an error, never a zero-row guess).
- Calibration and eval are DISJOINT token slices of the same corpus; realized coverage is reported above.
- MEASUREMENT-ONLY — promotion is katgpt-rs-side and waits on these gates.
